. COMPLETED ENOUGH OF THE ADVENTURE.": RETURN.
  $610A,$49 Line 254: LET K=K+A: PRINT "NAME GAME TO BE SAVED ?": INPUT "NAME
. ?"; LINE N$: SAVE N$ LINE VAL "6500": LET K=K-A: RETURN.
